# Place game UI template PNG files here for OpenCV template matching.
# Examples:
#   play_button.png        — The PLAY button on any game's main menu
#   bloons_play_btn.png    — Bloons TD6 specific PLAY button
#   dismiss_x.png          — Generic close/dismiss X button
#   loading_spinner.png    — Loading indicator (to detect loading screens)
#
# Naming convention: <game_name>_<element_name>.png  or  <generic_element>.png
# Threshold: 0.75 (configurable in .env as TEMPLATE_THRESHOLD)
